# BuildKit needs the ** glob to match nested workspace dirs.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/lib
**/.expo
**/web-build
.git
*.log
.DS_Store
# Local env files hold real credentials. The builder copies packages/backend/
# whole, so without this a developer's .env reaches a build-stage layer (and a
# local build cache) even though the runtime stage never copies it.
**/.env
**/.env.*
